OL,3,GNEWSAStar saxophonist awarded freedom
OL,4,Aof hometown
OL,5,
OL,6,FStar saxophonist Jess Gillam has been
OL,7,Fawarded the freedom of her hometown on
OL,8,Fthe first stage she ever played on.
OL,10,FUlverston Town Council described Gillam
OL,11,F- who started playing saxophone aged
OL,12,Fseven, has performed at major
OL,13,Finternational venues and holds an MBE
OL,14,Ffor services to music - as an
OL,15,F"incredible talent" and had "helped put
OL,16,Fthe town on the map".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
