OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStar saxophonist awarded freedom
OL,4,Aof hometown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 28-year-old first organised
OL,7,Fconcerts at the Coronation Hall aged 12
OL,8,Fand went on to make history as the
OL,9,Fyoungest BBC Radio 3 presenter,
OL,10,Flaunching her own show called b@KThis
OL,11,FClassical Life, which is now in its
OL,12,Feighth season.
OL,14,FShe was presented with the award to a
OL,15,Ffull house of 560 people at the same
OL,16,Fvenue on Friday, adding Ulverston was
OL,17,F"brilliant".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
